[agent] 1. **Ingested** `data/features.csv` (13,500 rows, 150 entities × 90 days) into a feature group `drift_features` via `hops fg create` + `hops fg insert`. I used a composite primary key `(entity_id, event_time)` so the daily time series was preserved rather than upserted away.
